DESCRIPTION >
    Setup & Health: count of events carrying any paid click ID OR paid UTM/ST
    param, trailing 30d. Tenant-scoped; prunes via (site_id, timestamp).
    Faithful 1:1 port of setup-doctor.js's queryHogQL call at
    api/lib/setup-doctor.js:111 (queryName 'doctor_paid_params_count').
    Typed-column translation (SCOPE_v3.md §2.6): properties.site_id -> site_id;
    14 click-id fields are typed columns (see doctor_last_click_id.pipe).
    JSON-BAG FIELDS HIT (flagged, not silently typed — §2.6 lists these as
    bag-only, NOT typed columns): utm_id, st_campaign_id, st_adgroup_id — read
    via JSONExtractString(properties, '<key>'). JSONExtractString returns ''
    (never NULL) for a missing key, so the live query's `(x != '' AND
    isNotNull(x))` pattern collapses to `JSONExtractString(...) != ''` for
    these three fields — semantically equivalent (missing-or-empty both yield
    ''), not a behavior change, just JSONExtract's null-handling contract.
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

NODE doctor_paid_params_count_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT count() AS paid_params_count
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 30 DAY
      AND (
        (gclid != '' AND isNotNull(gclid)) OR
        (gbraid != '' AND isNotNull(gbraid)) OR
        (wbraid != '' AND isNotNull(wbraid)) OR
        (fbclid != '' AND isNotNull(fbclid)) OR
        (msclkid != '' AND isNotNull(msclkid)) OR
        (ttclid != '' AND isNotNull(ttclid)) OR
        (twclid != '' AND isNotNull(twclid)) OR
        (li_fat_id != '' AND isNotNull(li_fat_id)) OR
        (li_fatid != '' AND isNotNull(li_fatid)) OR
        (dclid != '' AND isNotNull(dclid)) OR
        (snapclid != '' AND isNotNull(snapclid)) OR
        (pclid != '' AND isNotNull(pclid)) OR
        (sccid != '' AND isNotNull(sccid)) OR
        (ko_click_id != '' AND isNotNull(ko_click_id)) OR
        (JSONExtractString(properties, 'utm_id') != '') OR
        (JSONExtractString(properties, 'st_campaign_id') != '') OR
        (JSONExtractString(properties, 'st_adgroup_id') != '')
      )

TYPE endpoint
